[
  {
    "id": "c001",
    "name": "Declarations — Claims-Made and Reported Basis",
    "text": "THIS POLICY IS WRITTEN ON A CLAIMS MADE AND REPORTED BASIS AND COVERS ONLY CLAIMS FIRST MADE AGAINST THE INSUREDS DURING THE POLICY PERIOD OR THE EXTENDED REPORTING PERIOD, IF APPLICABLE, AND REPORTED IN WRITING TO THE INSURER PURSUANT TO THE TERMS HEREIN. THE LIMIT OF LIABILITY AVAILABLE TO PAY JUDGMENTS OR SETTLEMENTS SHALL BE REDUCED AND MAY BE TOTALLY EXHAUSTED BY AMOUNTS INCURRED AS DEFENSE COSTS. THE AMOUNT AVAILABLE TO PAY DEFENSE COSTS IS SUBJECT TO A MAXIMUM AGGREGATE LIMIT OF LIABILITY. PLEASE READ THIS POLICY CAREFULLY."
  },
  {
    "id": "c002",
    "name": "Declarations — Items 1–2",
    "text": "COMPANY: Axis insurance Company | |POLICY NUMBER: MNN 747114/01/2071 | tem 1, Parent Company: tem 2. Policy Period: Financial Industry Requlatory Authority a. Inception Date March 31. 2011 9509 Key West Avenue ; b. Expiration Date March 31.2012 Rockville, MD 20850 Attn: Office of the General Counsel — Contracts Group Both dates at 12:01 a.m. atthe address listed in Itern 1"
